From: lfdevs <lfdevs@lfdevs.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 02:37:35 +0800
Subject: tests: cover Anland 5.13 transport and reconnects

Add a standalone mock daemon and consumer around the vendored producer transport so the Anland 5.13 wire ABI and descriptor ordering are exercised without a compositor or Android device.

Cover short handshake rejection, dmabuf metadata, extended input payloads and resource descriptors, output framing, audio and readiness channels, and render-fence delivery with and without an attached fd.

Drive one hundred consumer disconnect and reconnect cycles, checking fallback callbacks and the process fd baseline after every release to catch descriptor leaks and stale transport state.
